activity File Patent Application
activity Conduct Patent Search
activity Examine Patent Application
activity Grant Patent
activity Reject Patent Application
activity File Trademark Application
activity Conduct Trademark Search
activity Examine Trademark Application
activity Grant Trademark
activity Reject Trademark Application
activity File Copyright Registration
activity Examine Copyright Application
activity Grant Copyright
activity Reject Copyright Application
activity Appeal Decision
bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Patent Search: Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application Status
bind Grant Patent: Decision
bind Reject Patent Application: Application ID, Decision
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Trademark Search: Search Result
bind Examine Trademark Application: Application Status
bind Grant Trademark: Decision
bind Reject Trademark Application: Application ID, Decision
bind File Copyright Registration: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Examine Copyright Application: Application Status
bind Grant Copyright: Decision
bind Reject Copyright Application: Application ID, Decision
bind Appeal Decision: Application ID
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000000
Application Fee: float between 50.0 and 10000.0
Search Result: Clear, Conflict
Application Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Decision: Granted, Rejected
Init[File Patent Application] | |
End[Grant Patent] | |
Precedence[Conduct Patent Search, File Patent Application] | | |
Precedence[Examine Patent Application, Conduct Patent Search] |A.Application Status is Pending |T.Search Result is Clear |
Response[Examine Patent Application, Grant Patent] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Patent Application, Reject Patent Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Patent, Reject Patent Application] | | |
Precedence[Conduct Trademark Search, File Trademark Application] | | |
Precedence[Examine Trademark Application, Conduct Trademark Search] |A.Application Status is Pending |T.Search Result is Clear |
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Grant Trademark] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Reject Trademark Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Trademark, Reject Trademark Application] | | |
Precedence[Examine Copyright Application, File Copyright Registration] | | |
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Grant Copyright] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Reject Copyright Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Copyright, Reject Copyright Application] | | |
Precedence[Reject Patent Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Trademark Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Copyright Application, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |